g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/61/owlgnn0pg4o0iyphleugsg4upemy2s9.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E6%83%8A%E9%B8%BF%E7%BB%9D%E5%94%B1.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/61/owlgnn0pg4o0iyphleugsg4upemy2s9.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />惊鸿绝唱\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"天籁之音\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">天籁之音</font></span></span>]时，额外对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">不净飞刀</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"天籁之音\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">天籁之音</font></span></span>]时，能量消耗降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>点，额外对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有敌人触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">不净飞刀</font></span>]。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"面纱\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">面纱</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内存在敌人时，可消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>点能量并对最近敌人触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">不净飞刀</span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"天籁之音\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">天籁之音</font></span></span>]时，能量消耗降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>点，额外对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内所有敌人触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">不净飞刀</font></span>]，且持续期间自身攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"面纱\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">面纱</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内存在敌人时，可消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>点能量并对最近敌人触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">不净飞刀</span>]；若拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"天籁之音\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">天籁之音</font></span></span>]，则效果范围扩大<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格，并改为强制选中最近<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人触发。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"谋定之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/40px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/60px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/80px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"谋定之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/40px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/60px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/80px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：120<img alt=\"谋定之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/40px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/60px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/80px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 60<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\